{"id":26202,"path":"/vocabulary/a1/common-things-a1-english-vocabulary/","parentId":26178,"order":10,"section":"vocabulary","level":"a1","depth":3,"title":"Common things – A1 English Vocabulary","seo":{"title":"Common things – A1 English Vocabulary - Test-English","description":"Learn the names of common things in English with pictures, examples, and exercises. Build your basic vocabulary. Perfect for A1 learners!","image":"/media/uploads/A1-English-Vocabulary_Common-things.jpg"},"modified":"2023-10-11T08:09:31","kind":"lesson","parts":["<h2>Common Things</h2> <p>In this elementary <a href=\"/vocabulary\">vocabulary</a> lesson about Common Things, you will learn about objects and things that we use in our everyday lives. Check the explanation and do the exercises.</p> <hr> <h3>Exercise 1</h3> <h5>Choose the correct option to complete each sentence.</h5> <div data-quiz=\"924\"></div>","<h2>Common Things</h2> <h3>Exercise 2</h3> <h5>Choose the correct option for each gap.</h5> <div data-quiz=\"925\"></div>","<h2>Common Things</h2> <h3>Exercise 3</h3> <h5>Match the sentences/pictures with the terms.</h5> <p></p> <h6>Reload the page to play again. Here’s a link to our <a href=\"https://quizlet.com/es/819456829/common-things-in-english-a1-vocabulary-flash-cards/?i=4i1uip&amp;x=1jqt\">Quizlet study set</a> about Common Things.</h6>"],"explanation":"<h2>Common Things</h2> <p>In this A1 Elementary <a href=\"/vocabulary\">Vocabulary</a> Lesson, you will learn basic words related to Common Things that we use every day. The pictures and examples below will help you understand and remember the terms.<br> <br> <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-26941\" src=\"/media/uploads/common-things-a1-vocabulary.png\" alt=\"Infographic of 20 common items including a house, car, bicycle, book, and more for A1 English vocabulary learning.\" width=\"500\" height=\"1032\" loading=\"lazy\"></p> <h3>Example Sentences</h3> <ul class=\"vocab-ex\"> <li>I live in a big <span class=\"numPink\">1</span> <span><strong>house</strong></span> with my family.</li> <li>He drives an expensive <span class=\"numPink\">2</span> <span><strong>car</strong></span>.</li> <li>I ride my <span class=\"numPink\">3</span> <span><strong>bike</strong></span> in the park.</li> <li>I like to read a <span class=\"numPink\">4</span> <span><strong>book</strong></span> in bed.</li> <li>I use a <span class=\"numPink\">5</span> <span><strong>pen</strong></span> to write at school.</li> <li>I write and draw in my <span class=\"numPink\">6</span> <span><strong>notebook</strong></span>.</li> <li>I carry my books in a <span class=\"numPink\">7</span> <span><strong>backpack</strong></span>.</li> <li>I wear a <span class=\"numPink\">8</span> <span><strong>watch</strong></span> on my wrist.</li> <li>I use a <span class=\"numPink\">9</span> <span><strong>computer</strong></span> to play games.</li> <li>I often watch <span class=\"numPink\">10</span> <span><strong>TV</strong></span>.</li> <li>My grandmother wears <span class=\"numPink\">11</span> <span><strong>glasses</strong></span>.</li> <li>I sometimes wear yellow <span class=\"numPink\">12</span> <span><strong>shoes</strong></span>.</li> <li>I have money in my <span class=\"numPink\">13</span> <span><strong>wallet</strong></span>.</li> <li>This <span class=\"numPink\">14</span> <span><strong>key</strong></span> opens my front door.</li> <li>I use my&nbsp; <span class=\"numPink\">15</span> <span><strong>mobile phone</strong></span> to text and send emails.</li> <li>I put on my <span class=\"numPink\">16</span> <span><strong>headphones</strong></span> to listen to music.</li> <li>I always take my <span class=\"numPink\">17</span> <span><strong>umbrella</strong></span> when it rains.</li> <li>We need a <span class=\"numPink\">18</span> <span><strong>passport</strong></span> to travel.</li> <li>I wear a <span class=\"numPink\">19</span> <span><strong>hat</strong></span> on sunny days.</li> <li>I drink water from a <span class=\"numPink\">20</span> <span><strong>bottle</strong></span>.</li> </ul> <h3>Listen &amp; Practice: Vocabulary with Pronunciation</h3> <p>Here’s a video to help you review the vocabulary from this lesson and improve your pronunciation.</p> <div class=\"video-container\"> <div class=\"embed-container\"><div data-youtube=\"sy4oKZB-8QE\"></div></div> </div> <div class=\"separator-dots\"><span>Flashcards</span></div> <p>After completing the exercises in this lesson on Common Things, you can use the unit’s <a href=\"https://quizlet.com/819456829\">Vocabulary Flashcards</a> to revise and help you memorize the terms.</p>","quizzes":[{"id":924,"questions":[{"id":7825,"num":"1","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>A <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> is a bag that you carry on your back.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["TV","house","wallet","car","computer","book","backpack","shoes","mobile phone","umbrella"]}]},{"id":7828,"num":"2","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>A <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> is something that you read.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["house","umbrella","car","backpack","mobile phone","book","computer","shoes","TV","wallet"]}]},{"id":7829,"num":"3","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>A <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> is a thing you use to carry money and credit cards.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["mobile phone","car","umbrella","backpack","wallet","book","shoes","computer","TV","house"]}]},{"id":7830,"num":"4","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>A <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> is something you watch for entertainment.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["shoes","computer","book","house","umbrella","mobile phone","backpack","TV","wallet","car"]}]},{"id":7823,"num":"5","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>A <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> is a place where people live.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["shoes","mobile phone","car","TV","house","book","backpack","wallet","umbrella","computer"]}]},{"id":7824,"num":"6","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>A <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> is a vehicle you drive to move from one place to another.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["TV","shoes","mobile phone","backpack","car","umbrella","wallet","computer","house","book"]}]},{"id":7831,"num":"7","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span data-gap=\"0\"></span> are things that you wear on your feet.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["mobile phone","backpack","TV","computer","car","wallet","umbrella","house","shoes","book"]}]},{"id":7826,"num":"8","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>A <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> is a machine you use to play games and do work.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["umbrella","book","computer","TV","mobile phone","car","house","backpack","wallet","shoes"]}]},{"id":7832,"num":"9","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>A <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> is something you use to communicate with others.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["mobile phone","house","wallet","shoes","umbrella","computer","backpack","TV","book","car"]}]},{"id":7827,"num":"10","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>An <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> is an object that protects you from the rain.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["TV","shoes","car","wallet","house","backpack","umbrella","mobile phone","book","computer"]}]}]},{"id":925,"questions":[{"id":7834,"num":"1","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>A _____ is something you use to open doors. <br> </div>","choices":[{"id":13859,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>notebook </span>"},{"id":13860,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>key</span>"},{"id":13861,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>pen</span>"},{"id":13862,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>bike</span>"},{"id":13863,"letter":"E.","html":"<span>bottle</span>"}]},{"id":7837,"num":"2","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>A _____ of water is a container with water inside.</div>","choices":[{"id":13874,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>notebook </span>"},{"id":13875,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>key</span>"},{"id":13876,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>pen</span>"},{"id":13877,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>bike</span>"},{"id":13878,"letter":"E.","html":"<span>bottle</span>"}]},{"id":7833,"num":"3","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>A _____ is a book in which we can write or draw things. </div>","choices":[{"id":13854,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>notebook </span>"},{"id":13855,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>key</span>"},{"id":13856,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>pen</span>"},{"id":13857,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>bike</span>"},{"id":13858,"letter":"E.","html":"<span>bottle</span>"}]},{"id":7836,"num":"4","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>A _____ is a vehicle with two wheels.</div>","choices":[{"id":13869,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>notebook </span>"},{"id":13870,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>key</span>"},{"id":13871,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>pen</span>"},{"id":13872,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>bike</span>"},{"id":13873,"letter":"E.","html":"<span>bottle</span>"}]},{"id":7835,"num":"5","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>A _____ is something that people use to write with. </div>","choices":[{"id":13864,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>notebook </span>"},{"id":13865,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>key</span>"},{"id":13866,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>pen</span>"},{"id":13867,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>bike</span>"},{"id":13868,"letter":"E.","html":"<span>bottle</span>"}]},{"id":7840,"num":"6","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>A _____ is a document you need to travel to different countries. </div>","choices":[{"id":13889,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>watch</span>"},{"id":13890,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>glasses</span>"},{"id":13891,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>passport</span>"},{"id":13892,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>headphones</span>"},{"id":13893,"letter":"E.","html":"<span>hat</span>"}]},{"id":7839,"num":"7","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>_____ are things you wear on your eyes to see better.</div>","choices":[{"id":13884,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>watch</span>"},{"id":13885,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>glasses</span>"},{"id":13886,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>passport</span>"},{"id":13887,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>headphones</span>"},{"id":13888,"letter":"E.","html":"<span>hat</span>"}]},{"id":7841,"num":"8","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>_____ are things you wear when you want to listen to music.</div>","choices":[{"id":13894,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>watch</span>"},{"id":13895,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>glasses</span>"},{"id":13896,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>passport</span>"},{"id":13897,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>headphones</span>"},{"id":13898,"letter":"E.","html":"<span>hat</span>"}]},{"id":7842,"num":"9","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>A _____ is something that you wear on your head. </div>","choices":[{"id":13899,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>watch</span>"},{"id":13900,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>glasses</span>"},{"id":13901,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>passport</span>"},{"id":13902,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>headphones</span>"},{"id":13903,"letter":"E.","html":"<span>hat</span>"}]},{"id":7838,"num":"10","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>A _____ is something you wear to see the time.</div>","choices":[{"id":13879,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>watch</span>"},{"id":13880,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>glasses</span>"},{"id":13881,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>passport</span>"},{"id":13882,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>headphones</span>"},{"id":13883,"letter":"E.","html":"<span>hat</span>"}]}]}]}